sing this lonely territory is Makina, a young woman who knows only ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nypl.org/spotlight/world-literature-festival/recommended-translations\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... Taylor |\\n| 2003 The Booker Prizes |url= |access-date=2022-10-19 |website=thebookerprizes.com |language=en |archive-date=28 November 2022 |archive-url= |url-status=live }} | Shortlist | Damon Galgut | The Good Doctor | Atlantic Books | *John Carey (Chair) *A. C. Grayling *Francine Stock * Rebecca Stephens MBE *D. J. Taylor ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_winners_and_nominated_authors_of_the_Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d48\"},\"ref\":\"d48\",\"snippet\":\" ... Amy Arnold's Slip of a Fish landed a 2019 Goldsmiths Prize shortlisting, while Alia Trabucco Zerán's The Remainder was shortlisted for the Man Booker International Prize. Multiple translation prize wins and shortlistings for Gini Alhadeff's translation of I Am the Brother of XX by Fleur ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.andotherstories.org/about-us/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d49\"},\"ref\":\"d49\",\"snippet\":\" ... Man Booker Prize, winner, The Sense of an Ending\\n*2011 Costa Book Awards, shortlist, The Sense of an Ending\\n*2012: Europese Literatuurprijs\\n*2015: Zinklar Award at the first annual Blixen Ceremony in Copenhagen\\n*2016: Siegfried Lenz Prize\\n*2017: Officier in the Ordre National de la Légion d'Honneur ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Julian_Barnes\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"o